// Copy to `Secrets.xcconfig` (gitignored) and fill in. Config.xcconfig picks it up via `#include?`.
// Same shape as Faint's mobile/iosApp/Configuration — THE STANDARD for every frnk host on iOS:
// Info.plist forwards each value as `$(KEY)`, and the Kotlin bootstrap reads it from NSBundle.
//
// REQUIRED — the demo's own Sentry project DSN (Sentry → project → Settings → Client Keys; a public
// client key, not the auth token). The same value local.properties holds for demo-android.
// A blank value fails at launch naming the key. xcconfig treats "//" as a comment, so URLs are
// written with "$()" splitting the slashes:
//   SENTRY_DSN = https:/$()/<key>@<org>.ingest.sentry.io/<project>
SENTRY_DSN =

// No POSTHOG_API_KEY here: every frnk app reports to the one toolkit-wide PostHog project, whose
// key ships inside frnk (:analytics-posthog, FrnkPostHogProject). Only Sentry is per app.

// RevenueCat Test Store key (test_ prefix) — routes purchases to the Test Store, no App Store
// Connect needed (BACKLOG P3-3). Public key of the throwaway `frnk-demo` project.
REVENUECAT_API_KEY = test_qzjfFbAulTeDyCvtBnxOHsrKucH
